@startuml
[*] --> Bootstrapping : Daemon start

state Bootstrapping {
    [*] --> Initialising
    Initialising : Load mesh peer list & local VPN IP
    Initialising --> ProbingNetwork : Ping peers for active server heartbeat
}

state ClientOnly {
    state "Client Idle" as ClientIdle
    ClientIdle : Connected to remote server
    ClientIdle : Monitoring battle events & state
    
    state "Client In Battle" as ClientInBattle
    ClientInBattle : Exchanging battle turns with remote server
    
    ClientIdle --> ClientInBattle : Match started
    ClientInBattle --> ClientIdle : Match finished
}

state ClientAndServer {
    state "Local Client Component" as LocalClient
    LocalClient : Connected to localhost server instance
    LocalClient : Monitoring / participating in battles locally

    state "Server Component" as ServerComponent
    ServerComponent : Hosting /server endpoints for all mesh peers
    ServerComponent : Managing matchmaking & battles
    ServerComponent : Broadcasting periodic heartbeat with local IP
}

state "Promoting to Server" as Promoting {
    Promoting : Mount /server endpoints
    Promoting : Initialise lobbies & battle registry
    Promoting : Announce server presence with local IP
}

state "Relinquishing Server" as Relinquishing {
    Relinquishing : Detected active server with lower IP (Remote IP < Local IP)
    Relinquishing : Dismantle /server endpoints
    Relinquishing : Retarget local client to lower IP remote server
}

Bootstrapping --> ClientOnly : Active server found (Server IP is valid)
Bootstrapping --> Promoting : No server found on mesh (Timeout)

ClientOnly --> Promoting : Server heartbeat lost / Server unreachable
ClientOnly --> Promoting : Explicit promotion requested (CLI / RPC)

Promoting --> ClientAndServer : Server initialised

ClientAndServer --> Relinquishing : Received heartbeat from lower IP peer\n[Peer IP < Local IP]
Relinquishing --> ClientOnly : Relinquishment complete

ClientAndServer --> ClientAndServer : Received heartbeat from higher IP peer\n[Peer IP >= Local IP: Ignore conflict / Maintain server]

ClientOnly --> [*] : Daemon stopped
ClientAndServer --> [*] : Daemon stopped
@enduml
